  "id": "normalize",
  "term": "normalize",
  "definition": "In this social-psychology context, to normalize means to make a harmful or unfair practice come to be seen as ordinary, acceptable, or necessary within a group or culture. It describes a process by which repeated beliefs and expectations can hide the seriousness of mistreatment and lead people to accept it.",
