      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports normalization as a mechanism for legitimizing and sustaining sport bullying/structural violence, and includes “normalization” as part of a “cultural obscuration mechanism,” but it does not explicitly state that normalization works by “repeated beliefs and expectations” or that it “hides the seriousness of mistreatment.”",
        "The definition’s phrasing “harmful or unfair practice” goes beyond what the packet directly specifies; the packet describes “sport bullying” and “structural violence,” but does not clearly support the term “unfair” as part of the definition of normalize in this context."
